"""Common definitions and utilities for Z-Bot tasks.

Vendored from ksim-zbot (kscalelabs/ksim-zbot, MIT) `ksim_zbot/zbot2/common.py`.
Local changes for this build ("Pixel", 16 DoF, 5-DoF legs):
  * Asset paths default to sim/assets/zbot-pixel (generated by sim/tools/build_model.py).
  * get_actuators(): joints are ordered by MuJoCo joint order (nn_id) instead of servo id.
    Upstream sorted by servo id, which only works when both orders happen to coincide --
    with this build's real servo ids (hip_pitch=x1 but third joint in the kinematic chain)
    the sys-ID parameters and kp/kd would land on the WRONG joints. The physics ctrl vector
    is in MuJoCo actuator order, so that is the order the parameter arrays must follow.
    Servo ids remain in metadata.json purely as the deployment mapping.
"""

